computation in horizon_collect.c follows ComputeXidHorizons() in
src/backend/storage/ipc/procarray.c, a small macro is taken from the same
file, and the code follows PostgreSQL's coding conventions and reads its
internal data structures. Those portions remain under the PostgreSQL copyright:

